<title>USA: Koger Equity Inc Q1 net rises to $0.25/shr.</title>
<headline>Koger Equity Inc Q1 net rises to $0.25/shr.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In Thousands Except per Share Data)</p>
<p>					     For the Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						  3/31/97	   3/31/96</p>
<p> Rental revenues			   $ 25,383	  $ 23,985</p>
<p> Total revenues				26,943	    25,177</p>
<p> Net income				     5,693	     3,016</p>
<p>Earnings per common share:</p>
<p>						     0.25		0.16</p>
<p>Weighted average shares outstanding:</p>
<p>						   22,360	    18,577</p>
<p>		  Funds from operations    10,594	     8,199</p>
<p> Funds from operations, per share	  0.47		0.44</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
